      "text": "Antidote flumazenil:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " use = controversial (toxicity if indications, administration and monitoring aren't appropriate; toxicologist consult recommended); it can precipitate life-threatening w.draw (eg, seizures)."
